#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A definite integral is made by using <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo> for the upper limit of integration and "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> for the lower "
