#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Reposition the cursor in front of the integral after making the first of the "
"limits."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Positioning Indices"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The upper or lower index can be positioned by highlighting the desired text. "
"In this example, an arrow is needed above the P, in dP. Using <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo> places the desired "
"vector symbol in the wrong place; namely above the <quote>d</quote>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The problem is solved by highlighting only the P in "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"index_smear.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject> and then entering "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>U</keycap></keycombo>. Here is the "
"correct result."
msgstr ""

